     xs: ["(b) Draw AB = 6 cm. At A make a 25° angle. Mark C on the arm with AC = 3 cm. Join BC.", "(c) Draw AB = 8 cm. At A make a 120° angle (an obtuse angle). Mark AC = 3 cm. Join BC.", "In each case exactly one triangle is formed."],
