     xs: ["(a) 35 + 150 = 185 ≥ 180: cannot.", "(b) 70 + 30 = 100 < 180: can.", "(c) 90 + 85 = 175 < 180: can.", "(d) 50 + 150 = 200: cannot. So (b) and (c)."],
